{"componentChunkName":"component---src-components-module-blog-post-index-jsx","path":"/posts/til-insert-current-time-vs-code/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"author":"Gokul prabhu","siteUrl":"https://codefromdude.com"}},"post":{"html":"<p>Cmd + shift + p -> configure user snippets -> new global snippets -> paste the following snippet -> save -> and type <code class=\"language-text\">currenttime</code></p>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token property\">\"current time\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token property\">\"prefix\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"currenttime\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token property\">\"body\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token string\">\"$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-${CURRENT_DATE}T$CURRENT_HOUR:$CURRENT_MINUTE:$CURRENT_SECOND.000Z\"</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token property\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Insert current time\"</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Supported snippet variables can be found <a href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_20#_more-snippet-variables\">here</a>.\nMore about <a href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/userdefinedsnippets\">vs code snippets</a>.</p>","excerpt":"Cmd + shift + p -> configure user snippets -> new global snippets -> paste the following snippet -> save -> and type  Supported snippet…","timeToRead":1,"tableOfContents":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Insert current time in vs code using snippet","path":"til-insert-current-time-vs-code","tags":["productivity","vs code"],"date":"2022-09-15T22:16:11.000Z","parentPath":null}},"parentPost":null,"siblingPosts":{"edges":[]},"previousPost":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Ostrich algorithm"}},"nextPost":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Setting up github custom domain"}}},"pageContext":{"parentPath":null,"relatedPosts":[{"title":"Find disk usage sorted by size","path":"til-find-diskusage-sorted-by-size","date":"2023-07-11T17:26:02.000Z"},{"title":"Find process using a port","path":"til-find-process-occupies-a-port","date":"2023-07-06T23:27:48.000Z"},{"title":"Top 10 tools you need as developer","path":"top-10-tools-you-need-as-dev","date":"2023-03-11T13:07:07.000Z"}],"pageId":"cc99bb6b-6159-556f-afb4-2e9f36aff786","previousPagePath":"/posts/til-ostrich-algorithm/","previousItem":{"node":{"id":"83e4a41d-0a40-5821-808c-4061b6c008ad","frontmatter":{"title":"Ostrich algorithm","path":"til-ostrich-algorithm","parentPath":null,"date":"2022-10-02T07:58:25.000Z","categories":["today i learned","algorithm"],"tags":["algorithm","ostrich algorithm","programming"]}},"context":{"parentPath":null,"relatedPosts":[{"title":"Find disk usage sorted by size","path":"til-find-diskusage-sorted-by-size","date":"2023-07-11T17:26:02.000Z"},{"title":"Find process using a port","path":"til-find-process-occupies-a-port","date":"2023-07-06T23:27:48.000Z"},{"title":"Top 10 tools you need as developer","path":"top-10-tools-you-need-as-dev","date":"2023-03-11T13:07:07.000Z"}]}},"previousPageId":"83e4a41d-0a40-5821-808c-4061b6c008ad","nextPagePath":"/posts/github-custom-domain/","nextI